{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"23":{"eng-name":"Chapters on Shares of Inheritance","ara-name":"كتاب الفرائض"}},"section_detail":{"23":{"hadithnumber_first":2719,"hadithnumber_last":2752,"arabicnumber_first":2719,"arabicnumber_last":2752}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2734,"arabicnumber":2734,"text":"Rapporté par la fille de Hamzah : « Mon esclave affranchi est décédé, laissant une fille. Le Messager d’Allah (ﷺ) a partagé ses biens entre moi et sa fille, me donnant la moitié et à elle l’autre moitié. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Very Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":23,"hadith":16},"chapter":{"id":7,"ara-name":"باب مِيرَاثِ الْوَلاَءِ","eng-name":"Inheritance of Wala’","isFirstHadith":false}}]}